# Keep LF in the working tree, not just in the repo.
#
# With core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) a checkout rewrites these
# to CRLF. A skill's SKILL.md frontmatter was observed to parse wrong that way:
# the skill registered under its H1 instead of its description, and the description
# is the only surface the model reads to decide whether to fire the skill. It fails
# silently, so pin the endings rather than rely on noticing.
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
